      "laTeX": "$${\\displaystyle \\Delta U_{sistema\\,(ciclo)}=0}$$",
      "laTeXNormalized": "\\Delta U_{sistema(ciclo)}=0",
      "source": "wikipedia",
      "sourceUrl": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Principios_de_la_termodin%C3%A1mica",
