    {
      "id": "wp-en-61127882-d0",
      "type": "definition",
      "text": "The Laws of Thermodynamics (Spanish: Las leyes de la termodinámica) is a 2018 Spanish comedy film directed and written by Mateo Gil.",
      "source": "wikipedia",
